{"vid":"EnbmNjzk30M","source":"EnbmNjzk30M.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"Just 33 days after signing his first NBA contract"},{"t":2.8,"txt":"in 2009, Lanny Smith suffered a career-ending knee injury."},{"t":7,"txt":"Afterwards, he transitioned to entrepreneurship,"},{"t":9.1,"txt":"and in 2020, he launched an athleisure brand"},{"t":11.3,"txt":"called Actively Black."},{"t":12.7,"txt":"Smith's company donates a meaningful percentage"},{"t":14.7,"txt":"of its profits to organizations and programs"},{"t":17.1,"txt":"that support Black communities in the United States."},{"t":20.3,"txt":"LANNY SMITH: The first brand that I actually"},{"t":22.2,"txt":"launched is called active faith, a faith-based sports apparel"},{"t":25.4,"txt":"brand."},{"t":26.4,"txt":"Launched that brand out of my mom's house in 2010,"},{"t":30.4,"txt":"had some great success with it."},{"t":33.4,"txt":"Unfortunately, we do have to deal"},{"t":35.7,"txt":"with the realities of society."},{"t":37.4,"txt":"I was actually hiding myself from people knowing that I was"},{"t":40.7,"txt":"the founder of Active Faith."},{"t":42.5,"txt":"I was afraid that if they knew it was this young Black male"},{"t":45.2,"txt":"that was the founder that it would"},{"t":47.1,"txt":"have a negative impact on the business."},{"t":49.7,"txt":"And unfortunately, I had multiple experiences"},{"t":54.3,"txt":"that supported that fear."},{"t":56.3,"txt":"There was a group that was emailing"},{"t":57.7,"txt":"in that had interest in possibly investing in Active Faith"},{"t":62,"txt":"and go back and forth over email,"},{"t":64.3,"txt":"set up the in-person meeting."},{"t":66.2,"txt":"I'll never forget walking through those doors"},{"t":68.1,"txt":"and just seeing the looks on their faces."},{"t":69.8,"txt":"They were shocked that it was me, and all of a sudden,"},{"t":72,"txt":"they weren't interested in investing anymore."},{"t":74,"txt":"My parents raised me to be proud of who I am,"},{"t":76.3,"txt":"to be proud of my culture."},{"t":78.4,"txt":"To be hiding myself for those reasons"},{"t":80.3,"txt":"was something that I struggled with internally."},{"t":82.5,"txt":"And so in 2018, the movie Black Panther came out"},{"t":87.8,"txt":"and it shows the power of representation."},{"t":91.9,"txt":"That was my first time really seeing"},{"t":93.9,"txt":"a superhero that looked like me, and it was just"},{"t":95.9,"txt":"such a powerful thing."},{"t":97.8,"txt":"And I saw the way the Black community"},{"t":99.3,"txt":"and the entire diaspora really came together"},{"t":102.5,"txt":"around Black Panther and the movie."},{"t":105.4,"txt":"I remember walking out of the theater saying,"},{"t":107.3,"txt":"man, I want to create a brand that"},{"t":109.6,"txt":"makes my people feel the way that we felt in that movie."},{"t":114.4,"txt":"When you make something that makes"},{"t":117.7,"txt":"somebody feel a certain type of way,"},{"t":119.9,"txt":"people might forget what you say,"},{"t":121.6,"txt":"but they'll never forget how you made them feel."},{"t":123.9,"txt":"I think that's part of the success"},{"t":125.4,"txt":"that we've had is people are getting the product,"},{"t":128.7,"txt":"they're buying into the brand, and how they feel changes."},{"t":134.1,"txt":"One of my favorite pieces of feedback I get"},{"t":136,"txt":"is when there's complete strangers who are in an airport"},{"t":139.1,"txt":"or somewhere and they see each other wearing Actively Black,"},{"t":141.7,"txt":"and then they have a conversation."},{"t":143.6,"txt":"They connect over them both being part of this tribe."},{"t":146.9,"txt":"There's power in that."},{"t":148.2,"txt":"The negative images, the oppression,"},{"t":152.5,"txt":"all the things that have been-- the negative things that"},{"t":154.8,"txt":"have been attached to being Black,"},{"t":156.5,"txt":"we're moving our people away from that"},{"t":158.5,"txt":"and talking about the greatness that lives within us."},{"t":162.7,"txt":"The Nikes of the world, the Adidas, the Puma,"},{"t":165,"txt":"et cetera, et cetera, Nike wants you to be"},{"t":166.8,"txt":"a walking billboard for Nike."},{"t":168.1,"txt":"They want you to wear the swoosh across your chest"},{"t":170.2,"txt":"and be a walking billboard for Nike."},{"t":171.8,"txt":"The power and the brand and what we're"},{"t":173.6,"txt":"building with Actively Black is that my customers, the tribe,"},{"t":176.9,"txt":"they don't see themselves as a walking billboard"},{"t":179.1,"txt":"for Actively Black."},{"t":180.3,"txt":"They actually see Actively Black as something"},{"t":182.3,"txt":"that is the billboard for them."},{"t":185.7,"txt":"Giving back and impacting our community is--"},{"t":189.4,"txt":"it's part of the why, of why we're doing this."},{"t":191.3,"txt":"In 2022, we did over 5 million in revenue."},{"t":195.2,"txt":"We donated $500,000 back into the Black community."},{"t":198.8,"txt":"So that's 10% of our revenue."},{"t":201.5,"txt":"When our audience also sees that they're actually"},{"t":205.1,"txt":"about what they're talking about,"},{"t":206.4,"txt":"like this isn't just lip service,"},{"t":208,"txt":"they're actually putting action behind it,"},{"t":210.6,"txt":"it continues to have that compounding effect"},{"t":212.5,"txt":"because now we get those comments all the time where"},{"t":215.3,"txt":"our customers are like you know what."},{"t":217.1,"txt":"I know that my money is going to something that's"},{"t":219.8,"txt":"also going back into my community that's"},{"t":221.8,"txt":"also helping somebody."},{"t":223.1,"txt":"I don't mind spending this money with Actively Black."},{"t":225.3,"txt":"You know what I mean?"},{"t":225.9,"txt":"I want to spend my money with Actively Black"},{"t":227.6,"txt":"because I know that it's going for good."},{"t":229.4,"txt":"That makes me-- that makes me very proud,"},{"t":231.5,"txt":"and this is just the beginning of that."},{"t":234.7,"txt":"Some people will look at you're serving a niche"},{"t":238.1,"txt":"audience as a negative, but to me,"},{"t":240.1,"txt":"that's actually the positive."},{"t":241.7,"txt":"Actually that is the unlock."},{"t":243.3,"txt":"That is the way that you stand out and give yourself"},{"t":248,"txt":"the best chance of success."},{"t":249.5,"txt":"I can't compete with Nike on research and development,"},{"t":252.3,"txt":"on R&D. We don't have a budget for that."},{"t":254.1,"txt":"I can't compete with them on the technical side of the product."},{"t":256.7,"txt":"Can't compete with them on so many different things."},{"t":259.4,"txt":"But I have a place where Nike cannot compete with me."},{"t":262.7,"txt":"They cannot out Black culture a company that is literally built"},{"t":268.1,"txt":"from that."},{"t":268.8,"txt":"That's our foundation."},{"t":269.7,"txt":"That's who we are."},{"t":270.8,"txt":"We are this 365 days out of the year."},{"t":274.1,"txt":"It's not just a Black History Month collection"},{"t":276.7,"txt":"that Nike's going to release that."},{"t":278.2,"txt":"You know what I'm saying?"},{"t":278.8,"txt":"It's not just for Juneteenth."},{"t":280.1,"txt":"Those giants cannot compete in that space."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"Just"},{"t":0,"w":"33"},{"t":0,"w":"days"},{"t":0,"w":"after"},{"t":0,"w":"signing"},{"t":0,"w":"his"},{"t":0,"w":"first"},{"t":0,"w":"NBA"},{"t":0,"w":"contract"},{"t":2.84,"w":"in"},{"t":2.84,"w":"2009,"},{"t":2.84,"w":"Lanny"},{"t":2.84,"w":"Smith"},{"t":2.84,"w":"suffered"},{"t":2.84,"w":"a"},{"t":2.84,"w":"career-ending"},{"t":2.84,"w":"knee"},{"t":2.84,"w":"injury."},{"t":6.96,"w":"Afterwards,"},{"t":6.96,"w":"he"},{"t":6.96,"w":"transitioned"},{"t":6.96,"w":"to"},{"t":6.96,"w":"entrepreneurship,"},{"t":9.14,"w":"and"},{"t":9.14,"w":"in"},{"t":9.14,"w":"2020,"},{"t":9.14,"w":"he"},{"t":9.14,"w":"launched"},{"t":9.14,"w":"an"},{"t":9.14,"w":"athleisure"},{"t":9.14,"w":"brand"},{"t":11.33,"w":"called"},{"t":11.33,"w":"Actively"},{"t":11.33,"w":"Black."},{"t":12.702,"w":"Smith's"},{"t":12.702,"